stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Accepted: Start here - /exec with exec id
  [*] --> Tombstone: cancel names unknown id
  Tombstone --> Terminal: later /exec gives cancelled, no spawn
  Accepted --> Terminal: spawn error gives spawn_failed
  Accepted --> Running: spawn returns PID, deadline starts
  Running --> Terminal: leader exit gives exited or signalled
  Running --> Arbitrate: deadline or cancellation
  state Arbitrate <<choice>>
  Arbitrate --> Terminal: kernel wait finds leader exited
  Arbitrate --> Terminating: leader runs, timed_out or cancelled
  Terminating --> Terminal: group ended, record final
  Terminal --> [*]: evicted after 300 s or as oldest of 64
  note right of Terminal
    The first chosen outcome is final.
    A later event is recorded
    and changes nothing.
  end note
